OL,3,GNEWSAEverton's Thierno Barry on the
OL,4,Avideo he was scared to post
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead in hands, tears flowing.
OL,8,FIt's not a sight you often, if ever,
OL,9,Fsee from a top-flight footballer.
OL,11,FKeeping calm under pressure comes with
OL,12,Fthe job description, but there's a
OL,13,Fsense it's what's expected from fans
OL,14,Fand team-mates.
OL,16,FSo when Everton striker Thierno Barry
OL,17,Fposted a video last month of him
OL,18,Fbreaking down during a private training
OL,19,Fsession, it sparked conversation around
OL,20,Fshowing emotion in an industry where
OL,21,Frevealing any sort of vulnerability can
OL,22,Fbe a risk.
